From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:31:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/30] Close the cached atelet conn when its pod is replaced
 or gone

The dialer cached conns by pod UID, so a replaced atelet pod, a node
left with no atelet, and an atelet with no IP all kept the conn to the
old pod until the LRU evicted it. Key the cache by node, store the pod
UID and IP with the conn, and close it when either changes, the node has
no atelet, or the atelet has no IP.

Fork-Topic: atelet-dialer
Fork-Upstream: candidate
